ork! Eliza!","columns":18,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"And Peggy! The Schuyler sisters!","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Angelica!","columns":9,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Peggy!","columns":6,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Eliza!","columns":6,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Work!","columns":5,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"section","text":"[Primeira Parte]","columns":16,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"Daddy said to be home by sundown","columns":32,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"Daddy doesn’t need to know","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"Daddy said not to go downtown","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"Like I said, you’re free to go","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"But—look around, look around, the","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"Revolution’s happening in New York New York Angelica","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G7M(9)","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"Work!","columns":6,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#7/A#","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"It’s bad enough daddy wants to go to war","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"People shouting in the square","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"It’s bad enough there’ll be violence on our shore","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"New ideas in the air","columns":20,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"Look around, look around—","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"Angelica, remind me what we’re looking for","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G7M(9)","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"She’s lookin’ for me!","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"section","text":"[Refrão]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"Eliza, I’m lookin’ for a mind at work","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#7/A#","column":25,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bm7","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"I’m lookin’ for a mind at work!","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":27,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"I’m lookin’ for a mind at work!","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":28,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"Whooaaaaa! Whooaaaaa!","columns":21,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"Work!","columns":5,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-39","kind":"section","text":"[Segunda Parte]","columns":15,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-40","kind":"lyric","text":"There’s nothin’ like summer in the city","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Bm7","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-41","kind":"lyric","text":"Someone in a rush next to someone lookin’ pretty","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D/